const gaps = [
  ['Geometry is not collision','NeRF/3DGS can render a scene beautifully while surfaces interpenetrate, thin parts disappear, and collision meshes remain unusable.'],
  ['Motion is not action','A wrist, hand or object trajectory omits force, impedance, grasp mode and the counterfactual choices needed by a different embodiment.'],
  ['Contact is under-observed','Monocular RGB rarely identifies pressure, friction, compliance or whether proximity is load-bearing contact.'],
  ['Dynamics are non-identifiable','Many mass/friction/damping combinations explain the same short clip. Active robot probing is often more informative than passive video.'],
  ['A twin can overfit','An exact replica narrows variation. Digital cousins and domain randomization may transfer better when deployment differs from the scan.'],
  ['Success can be mismeasured','Chamfer distance, SSIM and reprojection error do not guarantee task success; simulated success does not guarantee ranking preservation in reality.'],
];

